<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Chris Stix reduced the rating on 3Com Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cut the earnings estimate by $0.12 per share to $2.25 for the year ending in May, and cut the estimate for 1998 by $0.15 to $3.05.</p>
<p>-- shares fell three to 49-1/4.</p>
</text>
